1
00:00:01,458 --> 00:00:01,958
What the?

2
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:12,416
That's odd. The clock-tower bell
is supposed to be switched off.

3
00:00:15,458 --> 00:00:16,333
Hajime!

4
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:21,750
Why is the bell ringing?!

5
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:42,833
Miyuki! Don't look!

6
00:00:43,875 --> 00:00:44,708
Is it Kogure?!

7
00:00:49,583 --> 00:00:50,291
This is...

8
00:00:53,833 --> 00:00:54,541
What happened?!

9
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,291
This is...

10
00:01:01,625 --> 00:01:02,791
What's going on?!

11
00:01:05,125 --> 00:01:08,333
Boss? Boss!

12
00:01:14,666 --> 00:01:16,875
Inspector! The clock tower!

13
00:01:16,875 --> 00:01:17,208
Right!

14
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:24,875
It's no good.

15
00:01:24,875 --> 00:01:27,333
It's locked!

16
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:32,625
The key's gone missing!

17
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:34,666
What?!

18
00:01:34,666 --> 00:01:36,333
We'll have to break down the door!

19
00:01:37,958 --> 00:01:38,958
Right, here goes!

20
00:01:40,583 --> 00:01:46,500
On the night the crimson ball bounced,
a bird announced the hour of heaven.

21
00:01:47,125 --> 00:01:48,583
The Mountain Child has come!

22
00:01:49,291 --> 00:01:50,583
It's a curse!

23
00:01:50,958 --> 00:01:53,708
A curse on those after the treasure!

24
00:01:55,375 --> 00:01:57,125
That's gruesome...
